		"description": "<p><strong>Defiance Rite — Recovery.</strong> 1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target: the ally regains LVL HP. You can spend mana (up to your unlocked spell tier) to increase the healing by 5 per mana spent. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using this Rite checks the target for your Soul Touched and removes it (the module warns but lets you proceed if the target isn’t marked).</em></p><p><em>[A] Heals LVL HP. [M] Extra mana: spend it on your mana bar and add +5 healing per mana by hand.</em></p>",
